---
// About page: Team grid
---

<section id="about-team" class="bg-[rgba(245,239,230,0.4)] py-16 lg:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-[32px] lg:text-[36px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif text-center mb-4">
      Meet Our Team
    </h2>
    <p class="text-[#4B5563] text-[16px] max-w-[700px] mx-auto text-center mb-12">
      Every case at Michelle Turpin P.C. is handled by experienced attorneys and tax professionals. Get to know the team that will fight for you.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <!-- Michelle Turpin -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-[8px] overflow-hidden shadow-md border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-lg transition flex flex-col">
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/assets/media/66b10a5de25c2598f7d5d078_60a2dbb60d091276406b000f_michelle-turpin-utah-tax-attorneys-1024.webp"
            alt="Michelle Turpin, Attorney"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col">
          <h3 class="text-[22px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-1">Michelle Turpin</h3>
          <p class="text-[#C1272D] text-[14px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Attorney</p>
          <p class="text-[#374151] text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-4">
            With nearly 40 years of experience representing taxpayers before the IRS and state taxing authorities, Michelle Turpin is recognized as one of Utah's leading tax controversy attorneys. She has successfully handled thousands of complex tax cases, from routine audits to high-stakes criminal tax investigations.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-[#4B5563] text-[14px] space-y-1 mb-4 list-disc pl-5">
            <li>Juris Doctor, University of Utah School of Law (1989)</li>
            <li>LL.M. Masters in Taxation, University of San Diego (1990)</li>
            <li>Former intern, IRS Office of District Counsel</li>
            <li>Admitted to practice before Utah, Federal District Court and U.S. Tax Courts</li>
            <li>Specializes in federal and state tax controversy, criminal tax defense, and complex tax planning</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-gray-100">
            <span class="bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] text-[12px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Tax Controversy</span>
            <span class="bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] text-[12px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Criminal Tax Defense</span>
            <span class="bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] text-[12px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Offer in Compromise</span>
            <span class="bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] text-[12px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Audit Defense</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Spencer Evans -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-[8px] overflow-hidden shadow-md border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-lg transition flex flex-col">
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/assets/media/66b10b085282da0e4921fae4_66a7c1d00300fdfb40d61295_spencer-evans-p-500-320.webp"
            alt="Spencer Evans, Attorney"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col">
          <h3 class="text-[22px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-1">Spencer Evans</h3>
          <p class="text-[#C1272D] text-[14px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Attorney</p>
          <p class="text-[#374151] text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Spencer Evans brings nearly 20 years of exclusively practicing tax law. He started his career as a state tax attorney working for a state taxing agency and has significant experience working as a tax attorney for Big 4 accounting firms. His unique background provides invaluable insight into how both sides approach tax controversies.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-[#4B5563] text-[14px] space-y-1 mb-4 list-disc pl-5">
            <li>Juris Doctor, Florida State University School of Law (2005)</li>
            <li>Admitted to practice before Arizona, Utah, Federal District and U.S. Tax Courts</li>
            <li>Former government tax attorney</li>
            <li>13+ years at PwC and Deloitte representing taxpayers before state taxing agencies nationwide</li>
            <li>Nationwide sales tax audit defense specialist</li>
            <li>Expert in reverse sales tax audits and refund procurement</li>
            <li>Multi-state tax controversy resolution</li>
            <li>Federal and state tax appeals representation</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-gray-100">
            <span class="bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] text-[12px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Sales Tax Defense</span>
            <span class="bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] text-[12px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Multi-State Tax</span>
            <span class="bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] text-[12px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Tax Appeals</span>
            <span class="bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] text-[12px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Business Tax</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Staci Spencer -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-[8px] overflow-hidden shadow-md border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-lg transition flex flex-col">
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/assets/media/66b10d3c74fd8f4655dc9292_66a7c042b1fce28dd0106cc2_2024-head-shot-768.webp"
            alt="Staci Spencer, Enrolled Agent Tax Professional"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col">
          <h3 class="text-[22px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-1">Staci Spencer</h3>
          <p class="text-[#C1272D] text-[14px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Enrolled Agent Tax Professional</p>
          <p class="text-[#374151] text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-4">
            As a federally licensed Enrolled Agent, Staci Spencer has the authority to represent taxpayers before the IRS in all matters. Her comprehensive understanding of tax law and procedures makes her an invaluable advocate for our clients.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-[#4B5563] text-[14px] space-y-1 mb-4 list-disc pl-5">
            <li>Bachelor's degree in Accounting, Montana State University</li>
            <li>Member, National Association of Enrolled Agents</li>
            <li>15+ years of tax controversy and resolution experience</li>
            <li>Specializes in collection defense and penalty abatement</li>
            <li>Expert in individual and business tax preparation and compliance</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-gray-100">
            <span class="bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] text-[12px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Collection Defense</span>
            <span class="bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] text-[12px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Penalty Abatement</span>
            <span class="bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] text-[12px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Tax Preparation</span>
            <span class="bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] text-[12px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Compliance</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Richard Kennedy -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-[8px] overflow-hidden shadow-md border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-lg transition flex flex-col">
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/assets/media/66b10c86b41b5c9a2657e56b_649098d807292d2b33afe608_Richard-Kennedy2-320.webp"
            alt="Richard Kennedy, Attorney of Counsel"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col">
          <h3 class="text-[22px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-1">Richard Kennedy</h3>
          <p class="text-[#C1272D] text-[14px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Attorney of Counsel</p>
          <p class="text-[#374151] text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Richard Kennedy received his B.A. with High Honors from the Brigham Young University Honors Program in 1970 and his J.D. from the University of Utah in 1973, where he was the Schiller Scholarship recipient. He retired from the Office of Chief Counsel of the Internal Revenue Service, where he was the National Trust Coordinator and tried numerous cases.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-[#4B5563] text-[14px] space-y-1 mb-4 list-disc pl-5">
            <li>B.A. with High Honors, Brigham Young University Honors Program (1970)</li>
            <li>J.D., University of Utah (1973), Schiller Scholarship recipient</li>
            <li>Retired from the IRS Office of Chief Counsel</li>
            <li>Former National Trust Coordinator</li>
            <li>Published author in tax law journals including Taxes</li>
            <li>Admitted to practice in Utah, California, U.S. Tax Court, and various Federal Courts</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-gray-100">
            <span class="bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] text-[12px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">IRS Litigation</span>
            <span class="bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] text-[12px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Trust Fund Taxes</span>
            <span class="bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] text-[12px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Criminal Tax</span>
            <span class="bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] text-[12px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Appeals</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sandra Fratto (full width) -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-[8px] overflow-hidden shadow-md border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-lg transition flex flex-col md:col-span-2 md:flex-row">
        <div class="md:w-1/3 aspect-[4/3] md:aspect-auto overflow-hidden shrink-0">
          <img
            src="/assets/media/66b10cf0fad61721b7f67564_60eca3790ea8d1093610f23a_Michelle-Turpin-45-p-1080-1024.webp"
            alt="Sandra Fratto, Legal Assistant"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col">
          <h3 class="text-[22px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-1">Sandra Fratto</h3>
          <p class="text-[#C1272D] text-[14px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Legal Assistant</p>
          <p class="text-[#374151] text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Sandra Fratto brings over 30 years of legal experience across multiple practice areas, with specialized expertise in tax law matters. Her attention to detail and client-focused approach ensures every case receives thorough preparation and support.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-[#4B5563] text-[14px] space-y-1 mb-4 list-disc pl-5">
            <li>Over 30 years of legal experience</li>
            <li>Specialized expertise in tax law matters</li>
            <li>Thorough case preparation and client support</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-gray-100">
            <span class="bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] text-[12px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Case Preparation</span>
            <span class="bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] text-[12px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Client Support</span>
            <span class="bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] text-[12px] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Legal Administration</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
